    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species_Feats\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Species Feats\">Species Feats</a></i></p><p>You come from a hardy Species, but some of your people are better than others at avoiding certain kinds of harm.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Zabrak\" title=\"Zabrak\">Zabrak</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> You can reduce your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species\" title=\"Species\">Species</a> bonus to any one <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Defense\">Defense</a> to +0 and increase your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species\" title=\"Species\">Species</a> bonus to another <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Defense\">Defense</a> to +2. Once you change your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species\" title=\"Species\">Species</a> bonuses in this way, they cannot be changed back.</p>",
